"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4876240","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1838407329263566","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"update","title":"v0.3.2 Announcer Update","summary":"v0.3.2 Announcer UpdateThe race has a voice now. This update adds a full race announcer, a ground-up controller feel overhaul, a proper intro, and a load of audio and menu polish. A Race Announcer There is now a commentator calling your race in real time, so the track never feels quiet. He counts you in, calls the final laps, and hypes the run to the line.He reacts to what you actually do: taking the lead, getting overtaken, sliding, going big off a jump, landing a trick, or going down in a cras","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T12:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329263566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1837955055356125","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"update","title":"v0.3 Supercross Update","summary":"v0.3 Supercross Update The biggest DüRT update yet is here. Supercross joins the game, the handling got a full pass, and local split-screen is now solid. Here is everything that changed. Supercross Has Landed A stadium-style supercross track is now in the game, built by hand with rhythm sections, rollers and big jumps. Its own feel. Supercross does not ride like an outdoor moto track. In SX the bike runs at different speeds and the turn response is tuned tighter and more deliberate, so the rhyth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T08:44:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356125","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1836506165563053","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"DüRT Demo V0.2.2: Smoother Handling, Wall Riding, and Full Controller Support","summary":"DüRT Demo V0.2.2 A handling and compatibility patch. The bike turns better, slides along walls cleanly, the AI stops driving the wrong way, and it now works with basically any controller you plug in. 🏁 Reworked Steering Speed-sensitive steering: sharp and responsive when you are slow, calmer and more stable at high speed, so the bike is easy to place in corners and not twitchy flat out. 🧱 Smoother Wall Riding The bike now slides cleanly ALONG walls instead of sticking and scrubbing into them. Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T16:17:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1836506165559844","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"DüRT Demo V0.2.1: Difficulty, Controls Layout, and Controller Polish","summary":"DüRT Demo V0.2.1 A quick follow-up to V0.2, focused on difficulty options and making the menus feel great on a controller and Steam Deck. 🎚️ Difficulty Options A new difficulty setting in the Gameplay options, with a twist that keeps every race interesting. Choose Easy, Medium, or Hard. Even on lower settings a couple of rivals ride one tier above to keep you honest. On Easy, two opponents push at Medium pace; on Medium, two ride at Hard pace; on Hard, the whole field is Hard. 🎮 Controller and S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T10:31:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165559844","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1836506165558275","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"DüRT Demo V0.2 is Live: Local Split-Screen, Full Controller Support, and Better","summary":"DüRT Demo V0.2 is here This is the biggest demo update yet. Local split-screen, full controller and Steam Deck support, reworked bike handling, and smarter AI. Grab a friend and a second controller, or just take the bike out on the mud and feel the difference. 🏍️ Local Split-Screen (2 Players) Race a friend on the same screen. Pick your own rider each, choose your layout, and go. 2-player split-screen with vertical (side by side) or horizontal (top and bottom) layout. Every input works at once: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T14:09:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165558275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1835871199310710","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"update","title":"500 Wishlists Smashed: Big Update & Demo Incoming! 🏁","summary":"🏁 500 Wishlists, Thank You Riders!We just blasted past 500 wishlists on DüRT: Motocross Championship, and we couldn't have done it without you. Whether you played the early build, dropped feedback, or just hit that wishlist button: thank you. It genuinely means the world to a small team. You gave us a ton of detailed feedback, and we went through every single point. Here's what's fixed: 🔧 Handling Fixed the \"I randomly lose control of the bike\" issue. The bike no longer loses all grip on low-tra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T10:20:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1835236783567923","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: It Finally Rides Like a Dirt Bike","summary":"I've been heads-down for weeks with my hands in the physics, the camera, and the sound and DüRT has crossed the line from \"a bike on a track\" to something that actually feels like throwing a two-stroke around in the dirt. Fresh gameplay footage is below. Here's everything that changed. The Handling Got RealThis was the big one. The bike used to turn the same whether you were crawling or flat-out now it doesn't. Speed-sensitive steering you can't pivot on the spot anymore. The bike has to be roll","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T15:28:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1833334318575870","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"7 Different Dirt Bikes and Drivers Added!","summary":"7 different dirt bikes and driver graphical styles added. Going to add more soon. And Bike part updates will be added as feature! STAY TUNED! TELL YOUR FRIENDS.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-24T19:28:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318575870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677430-1833334318565888","game_id":"steam-4677430","kind":"announcement","title":"200 wishlists down | here's what got added","summary":"200 wishlists Hitting 200 wishlists this early matters more than you'd think — every wishlist genuinely pushes a solo-dev game further into Steam's algorithms. Thanks for putting this in your library plans. It actually helps. Quick rundown of what's been built recently and what's coming. New: Trick System Press the trick button mid-air to throw a Superman pose. Hold through the air, release before touchdown for a clean landing and a +500 SUPERMAN popup. Hold too long — eat dirt. Proper risk-and-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-20T10:06:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318565888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4677430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4677430":"2026-10-26T13:36:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4677430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:47Z"},"4876240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:27Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4677430","app_id":4677430,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fa76ef760e9f8df86a8078ea0bcd56c3e499c88e03addc2559744e8cd4486064","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Arcade motocross with a late-'90s PSX soul: throttle-controlled drifts, back-it-in braking, real air with tricks, and a screaming two-stroke. A full championship across motocross and supercross tracks, built hand-in-hand with its players. Wishlist now.","publishers":[{"name":"sourpickledev"}],"developers":[{"name":"sourpick